{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t今日是重陽節，特區政府早上在香港大會堂紀念花園，舉行官方紀念儀式，悼念於1941至45年間，為保衞香港而捐軀的人士。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n儀式早上8時開始，現場奏唱國歌，升旗禮後全場默哀兩分鐘，行政長官李家超致獻花圈。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n全國政協副主席梁振英、前行政長官曾蔭權，多名司局長、及立法會主席李慧琼等，都有出席。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T00:38:40.401671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:16:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T05:18:00.006903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T00:37:35.307857+00:00","content_hash":"ac59fbe3c217db081e7123663bc40b067dc4591bfdad8f189ab56ce97a789359","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}